   "evidence": "Lines 33-35 prove `univ.gcd t.marks = 1` via `univ.gcd_dvd (mem_univ t.affineNode)`. Lines 61-68 redo the same `gcd_dvd`-at-affine-node argument for `\u03b4 = (t.marks \u2218 e).toNat`.",
